    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37068" root="كفأ" body-key="k">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَفِىْءُ اللَّوْنِ</span></b> , and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اللون</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَكْفُوْءُ</span></b> , (K,) and
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اللون</span> ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَكْتَفِئُ</span></b> , (TA,) (tropical:)  <i>Changed in colour:</i>
(K:) said of the countenance and of other
things: as also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُكْتَفِتُ اللون</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُكْفَأُ الوَجْهِ</span> <i>Changed in countenance.</i> (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2- 
See <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كِفَآءٌ</span>. ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَفِىْءٌ</span> and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كِفْءٌ</span></b>  (as in the CK
and a MS. copy of the K) or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كِفِىْءٌ</span> (as in the
TA) <i>The bottom,</i> or <i>interior,</i> or <i>inside,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَطْن</span>,)
<i>of a valley.</i> (K.)

